{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-mass-tower-coefficient-stratification-table1-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:mass-tower-coefficient-stratification-table1-data","kind":"table","title":"Data table 1 from prop:mass-tower-coefficient-stratification","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-mass-tower-coefficient-stratification"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"mass-tower-coefficient-stratification-table1-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"tbl:mass-tower-coefficient-stratification-table1-data\"></a><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Bethe--Weizsäcker term</th>\n<th>Stratum <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Lambda_k</code></th>\n<th>Forced prefactor <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\alpha_k</code></th>\n<th>Reference</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda_V</code> (volume)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Lambda_0 = \\{(n)\\}</code></td>\n<td>trivial-block Markov trace</td>\n<td><a href=\"#prop:unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula\">Term 1 / descended</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda_S</code> (surface)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Lambda_1 = \\{(n{-}1, 1)\\}</code></td>\n<td>hook-stratum log-character</td>\n<td><a href=\"#prop:unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula\">Term 2 / single-gen tower</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda_{\\mathrm{pair}}</code> (pairing)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Lambda_2 \\ni (n{-}2, 2), (n{-}2, 1, 1)</code></td>\n<td>pair-stratum Plancherel sum</td>\n<td><a href=\"#prop:unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula\">Term 3 / pair-gen tower</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda_{\\mathrm{Wigner}}</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">Z = N</code> pairing)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Lambda_3</code> chirality-cell sub-stratum</td>\n<td>self-conjugate restricted weight</td>\n<td><a href=\"#prop:wigner-np-pairing\">Wigner <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">np</code> pairing</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda_{\\mathrm{shell}}</code> (shell correction)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Lambda_{\\geq 4}</code> universal tail</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">m_e \\cdot 8 G</code> from gravity prefactor</td>\n<td><a href=\"#prop:gravity-spectral-prefactor\">gravity prefactor</a>, <a href=\"#prop:plancherel-term-7-formulation\">Term 7</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">a_\\mathcal{K}</code> (knot factor)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Lambda_2</code> chirality projection</td>\n<td>normalised Gram pairing <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G_{\\beta, \\beta^*} / G_{\\mathbf{1}, \\mathbf{1}}</code></td>\n<td><a href=\"#prop:knot-factor-spectral-form\">knot factor spectral form</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">F_{\\mathrm{Pauli}}</code> (Pauli weight)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Lambda_0</code> vs <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Lambda_{n-1}</code></td>\n<td>sym/alt block trace ratio</td>\n<td><a href=\"#prop:pauli-factor-wedderburn\">Pauli factor Wedderburn</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/mass-tower-coefficient-stratification-table1-data.md","heading":"Table"}
